# Solid Runner text table (verified: glyph index = code-1 in the 12x11 font at $AE:8000, read by 84A98B;
# decoded intro "２１ＸＸ年。政治や経済..." at 0x090F1F and Tao's first line at 0x0A84CA).
# Kanji F9xx-FCxx (glyph (p-F8)*256+xx-1, up to FC C2) are read off the font in phase 4; until then they decode as [F9][xx].
